If you grip the pen tightly, your hand forces the entire pen to match your hand's exact movement, killing any independent vibration.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning2\insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058 \hich\af2\dbch\af31506\loch\f2 o\tab}By holding it loosely, you create a low-resistance, pivotable }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
