\insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058  The suction cup is a flat-faced cylinder, acting as a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058 blunt body}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058 
 in the airflow. This creates a massive turbulent wake and high pressure drag.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058 Centre of Pressure (CoP):}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058  
