\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058  To achieve a hit at range, the operator must apply significant }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058 superelevation}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
