\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid7951058\charrsid7951058  The holding force (F) is determined by \\(F = A \\times (P_\{atm\} - P_\{internal\})\\), where A is the area of the cup and \\(P_\{atm\}\\) is atmospheric pressure.
